{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mcuwxubRpG1795775739.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>私隱專員公署接獲康體通資料外洩通報，可能影響約九萬人的個人資料。</p><p></p><p>當中可能包括姓名、性別、出生日期、地址、電郵地址及電話號碼。私隱專員公署指，已根據既定機制，就事故展開調查，並提醒相關機構盡快通知受影響人士。</p><p></p><p>對於近期發生的資料外洩事故，私隱專員公署提醒市民提高警惕，若收到不明來歷或可疑的來電、短訊或電郵時，應提高警覺，切勿隨意開啟附件，點擊超連結或披露個人資料。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.792050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:12.605311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:18.747707+00:00","content_hash":"d42ae7ec71ff0b08183d6c23300542f91a1a2403ef49cd7c6e251d0301d77999","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.792050+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}